## Summary
Indian National Security Adviser Ajit Doval is in China to hold border talks with Chinese officials, including Foreign Minister Wang Yi. The discussions with Vice President Han Zheng focused on bilateral relations and addressing border tensions between the two countries.

## Key Points
- Indian NSA Ajit Doval visited China for diplomatic border discussions.
- He met with Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi and Vice President Han Zheng.
- The talks centered on bilateral relations and border issues between India and China.


